al?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A entrega decorre no dia da prova em Tui (10h30 \u00e0s 12h30 no Espazo Sociocultural Camilo Jos\u00e9 Cela) e na zona de partida em Valen\u00e7a (16h00 \u00e0s 18h00).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e quais os prazos oficiais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma Lap2Go at\u00e9 25 de novembro de 2026, com valores bonificados a partir de 14 \u20ac (8K) e 17 \u20ac (16K).\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":69575,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,497],"event_type_2":[726,820,62],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-68228","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-valenca-viana-do-castelo","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-viana-do-castelo"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-urban-trail-night-eurocidade-valenca-tui.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/68228","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=68228"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/68228\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70869,"href":"